    "title": "Solitaire for Seniors Game",
    "description": "<b>The best FREE large-card solitaire game, specially designed for seniors! Simple but addictive, enjoy this classic and challenging Solitaire for Seniors Game NOW!</b>\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd29 Large-card classic Solitaire and Spider Solitaire are both offered in this game. You can play two modes in ONE game. \ud83d\ude0d\r\n\r\n<b>100% FREE! Enjoy this classic & addictive solitaire collection game specially designed for seniors!</b> This Solitaire Card Game features large fonts and big cards, making it extremely easy to play with simple taps. Tons of random deals with different difficulties are waiting for you to play! With unlimited boosters, hints, and undo, you'll never worry about getting stuck anymore. Plus, enjoy two exciting game modes for endless fun. \ud83e\udd29\r\n\r\n<b>Definitely, this Solitaire Card Game is the Best choice for seniors!</b> Simple, clear, and clean design with large fonts and big cards makes it perfect for older adults. Beautiful graphics and a variety of delicate card faces, card backs, backgrounds, themes, and animation effects create a unique Solitaire experience. The auto-complete function ensures a better Solitaire score by saving time. <b>This game is designed to help seniors exercise their brains, enhance memory, and improve sleep quality.</b> \ud83d\udc96\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca1 <b>How to Play Classic Solitaire & Spider Solitaire</b> \ud83d\udca1\r\n\u2660 Drag or tap to move the available card. \r\n\u2665 In Classic Solitaire, your goal is to build up four foundation piles in ascending order, from Ace to King, each pile by suit.\r\n\u2665 In Spider Solitaire, your goal is to assemble 13 cards of a suit in descending sequence from King to Ace. Whenever a full suit of 13 cards is assembled, it will be removed from the game.\r\n\u2663 Move cards between tableau columns in descending order and alternating colors in Classic Solitaire. In Spider Solitaire, move cards in descending order within the same suit.\r\n\u2666 Use powerful boosters like Hints and Undo when you get stuck.\r\n\ud83c\udf89 When all the foundation piles in Classic Solitaire or all the suits in Spider Solitaire are completed, you win!\r\n\ud83c\udccf You can switch the modes freely, from Spider Solitaire to Classic Solitaire, or from Classic Solitaire to Spider Solitaire.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f <b>Key Features of Solitaire for Seniors Game</b> \ud83c\udf1f\r\n\u2665\ufe0f Large fonts and big cards, friendly to your eyes\r\n\u2665\ufe0f Totally FREE to play, super classic & addictive Spider and Classic Solitaire\r\n\u2665\ufe0f Tap to move, with fast and convenient auto-drags\r\n\u2665\ufe0f Fun events and daily challenges to enrich your gaming experience\r\n\u2665\ufe0f Tons of random deals, enjoy the excitement of uncertainty\r\n\u2665\ufe0f 21 levels of difficulty, from Beginner to Veteran\r\n\u2665\ufe0f Unlimited hints & undo, no worries when you get stuck\r\n\u2665\ufe0f Auto-complete & auto-hints available to save time\r\n\u2665\ufe0f Left-hand mode for comfortable play\r\n\u2665\ufe0f Multiple themes to choose from, including various backgrounds, card faces, and card backs\r\n\u2665\ufe0f Statistics to help you track your progress and growth\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udccf Solitaire is one of the most popular puzzle and card games around the world. If you are an enthusiastic fan of Patience games, Classic Solitaire, Freecell Solitaire, Spider Solitaire, Spiderette, Pyramid, TriPeaks, Mahjong, Cube, or Emperor, you will fall in love with this simple and relaxing Solitaire for Seniors Game! <b>Download it for FREE and have fun NOW!</b> \ud83c\udf8a\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://solitairecollection.gurugame.ai/policy.html\r\nTerms of Service: https://solitairecollection.gurugame.ai/termsofservice.html",
